&lt;j.schmidt@acme-automotive.de&gt; wrote:</div>
<blockquote style="margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px solid
#ccc;padding-left:1ex">
<p>Dear Tom,</p>
<p>As discussed, please find attached the first draft of our Master Supply
Agreement for the supply of process and cooling-water pumps, spare parts
and your remote condition monitoring service.</p>
<p>The draft is based on Acme's standard terms for strategic suppliers.
Please note in particular clause 10 (data protection and information
security), because your monitoring service will connect to our plant
networks, and clause 12 (liability).</p>
<p>I have copied Dr Felix Brandt from our legal department, who will handle
the legal points, and your legal team.</p>
<p>We would appreciate Kestrel's comments by Friday 23 October, so that we
can aim for signature in November.</p>
<p>Best regards</p>
